{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Legal requirement that an MP must serve a year before becoming Prime Minister",
        "additional_details": "We feel that it is undemocratic to bring in somebody who wasn't elected as an MP at the last election to become Prime Minister without a minimum term served as an MP.",
        "background": "We do not think that individuals should be parachuted into government to take up the post of Prime Minister without a minimum term of one years service from being elected.",
